  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dfe88ea1446f639428eb628f6eae278e, type: 3}
  m_Name: InfoPoint4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: At home there are so many small things you can do to help the environement.
  - speaker: 
    text: Like turning off the tap while brushing your teeth.
  - speaker: 
    text: Or growing flowers, herbs or vegetables and watch them grow. Choose native
      plants to help local wildlife.
  - speaker: 
    text: And lastly if you see any trash while you're walking, make sure to pick
      it up and put it in the bin.
  - speaker: 
    text: Small tasks like this can build up and help the environment!
